== go-yaml v4.0.0 Released

* ^go-yaml v4.0.0 was Released last week!^
* Painless migration from v2 or v3 for most users
* Already used by over 100 repos!

* New "With"-style options system
  * WithV2Defaults() and WithV3Defaults() option groups

* Shout out to the ^go-yaml dev team^!
  * Especially Christophe Colombier ^@ccoVeille^!!
  * Also %Colin Lacy% and %dims%

* ^v4 Plugin system can take YAML to new places^

----
== The go-yaml v4 Plugin System

* Plugin APIs reach deep into go-yaml code

* Original code becomes the default plugin for an API

* Each plugin has its own configuration settings

* You can implement your own plugin module for any API

+* This talk is about the New go-yaml Plugin System

  * But first...

