== What if YAML/YS actually compiled to Go code?!?!

* YAMLScript compiles to ^Clojure^ (a Lisp)
* There's a new Clojure dialect for Go called ^Glojure^
* Glojure compiles Clojure to ^Go^
* Go (cross-)compiles to ^Everything^!
  * WebAssembly (Browser & WASI)
  * Native binaries
  * Native shared libraries

* Check out Gloat!
  * ^GLO^jure ^A^utomation ^T^ool
  * Simple compilation of YS/Clojure -> Go
  * `ys --to=bin ...` uses it
  * https://gloathub.org/

